35,2,1,talk,Servas,,"The technicians are gone, yet the glasshouse crew remains strong. We must weigh this carefully.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Sakura,,Ooh! Free computing hours? That’s amazing! But animal costs jumped way up. Which projects need animals versus just computers?,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I found that catalogue-style awards still draw users a decade later, while mechanism-focused ones often end unresolved.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Takumi,,"Eleven weeks idle on the spectroscopy suite. That’s a disaster. Plus, breeding colonies overrun schedules twice as often. We need to avoid those traps.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Minako,,"The animal facility is accredited with veterinary cover, but glasshouses are fully booked. Technicians left, yet modelling applicants arrive.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Sakura, the free computing is a gift, but our senior analysts are abroad. We must not over-promise on simulation.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Servas, that’s tricky! If the analysts are gone, who runs the free computers? I’m worried the money won’t actually buy us the help we need!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I also saw that breeding colonies cause double the delays. We should probably avoid projects relying on live animals.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Daisuke, you’re right. Live colonies are a time sink. I’m not letting us get stuck in that mess again.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Takumi, the spectroscopy delay is critical. If B relies on that suite, it faces immediate risk. We must verify its independence.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Servas,,"@Minako, the glasshouse crew is intact, yet the technicians are gone. We must ask: can D survive without those missing hands?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Servas, that’s a scary thought! If the hands are gone, D might just be a fancy greenhouse with no one to water the plants!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I agree. The closeout files show mechanism-focused work often stalls. If D is too complex, it might just end up unresolved.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Minako, exactly. If B needs that broken suite, it’s dead on arrival. I refuse to fund a project that just sits around waiting for repairs.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Minako,,"@Servas, the glasshouse crew is intact, but the phenotyping technicians are gone. D’s success hinges on whether that remaining crew can absorb the technical load.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Servas,,"The hands are the true currency. We must fund what the remaining crew can actually sustain, not what we wish they could.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Sakura,,"I’m still stuck on the money! If animal costs are up but computers are free, does that mean B is actually cheaper than C?","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think we should favor the catalogue-style work. The records show it keeps delivering value long after the grant ends.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Takumi,,"@Daisuke, I hear you, but I’m not ignoring the schedule risks. If we pick something that stalls, the money is wasted.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Minako,,"The infrastructure is strained. We must fund what the current capacity can sustain, not what we hope it can become.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
